  <revision rev="3" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>79a6273d52c19010ad95dfb851b46700</srcmd5>
    <version>4.0.7</version>
    <time>1792059578</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 4.0.7
  * Remove unused (servern, netbiosname) and unnecessary (vers)
    mount options from the mount helper. The former two are not
    used by the mounter anymore and the latter is not needed,
    because the correct SMB protocol version (&gt;= 2.1) is
    negotiated during connection.
  * Adjust the rest of the programm to the changes made to the mount
    helper: Remove the SMB protocol version mount option, since it
    is not accepted by the mount helper anymore (it is actually not
    needed).
  * Updated handbook and translations. (forwarded request 1384479 from Kieltux)</comment>
    <requestid>1384856</requestid>
  </revision>
